            ]
           ],
           Cell[
            CellGroupData[
             {
              Cell[
               "Why \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]project toward the unconditional long-term drift rate\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]?",
               "Subsubsection"
              ],
              Cell[
               TextData[
                {
                 "In a stationary ARMA model, temporary deviations caused by shocks fade over time. As forecast horizon increases, predictions tend to move back toward the series\[CloseCurlyQuote] ",
                 StyleBox["unconditional mean", FontWeight -> Bold],
                 "."
                }
               ],
               "Text"
              ],
              Cell[
               TextData[
                {
                 "So if returns follow a stationary ARMA process with mean ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Mu]", TraditionalForm],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "\\mu",
