     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell[
         "6. Walk-Forward Backtesting (Rolling Window Evaluation)",
         "Section"
        ],
        Cell[
         "To rigorously verify model performance across differing market regimes (bull runs, pullbacks, and consolidations), we execute a walk-forward rolling backtest across 16 consecutive 20-day evaluation horizons spanning 2023\[Dash]2024.",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell["In each window:", "Text"],
        Cell[
         "1. Models are trained on the preceding 250 trading days (1-year lookback).",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "2. Models forecast expected average price over the subsequent 20 trading days.",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "3. Errors relative to realized prices are systematically recorded. ",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         CellGroupData[
          {
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             RowBox[
              {
               RowBox[
                {
                 "(*",
                 " ",
                 RowBox[
                  {
                   "Walk",
                   "-",
                   RowBox[
                    {
                     "Forward",
                     " ",
                     "Rolling",
                     " ",
                     "Evaluation",
                     " ",
                     "Engine"
                    }
                   ]
                  }
                 ],
                 " ",
                 "*)"
                }
               ],
               "\[IndentingNewLine]",
               "\t",
               RowBox[
                {
                 RowBox[{RowBox[{"windowLookback", "=", "250"}], ";"}],
                 "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                 "\t",
